        "slc_bf609b5fb0789ead11953d84ea8740691bddc75a8d023cc751671af2b5929000"
      ],
      "text": "GitHub Copilot surfaces ACP resource references only as tagged-file metadata without content, so the plugin appends referenced file content as plain text after the user's message as a workaround."
    },
