        "slc_bbc7ae7a30bba9f62be0fb4c265b90c494aee02b57cfd1f0caef80e7c1f908da"
      ],
      "text": "A prolonged EDT freeze (30+ seconds) can permanently stall the JCEF off-screen renderer; defenses include an EdtFreezeRecovery heartbeat monitor and a 2-second cooldown on file-open navigations to prevent cascading VCS git log/blame operations."
    },
