        "slc_7cc5f35a88f418cebe9aa5052981a892c94a448001fcf22603b138f08ffbf60f"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: tests run via Gradle (./gradlew test, :plugin-core:test, :mcp-server:test, with -Dinclude.integration=true for integration tests), and the project builds two plugin ZIPs (plugin-core and plugin-experimental) via buildPlugin tasks."
    },
